---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Signal from Noise — Rabbit Hole" description="The methodology for turning overwhelming content into accessible insight">
  <section class="hero-case">
    <a href="/rabbit-holes/" class="back-link">← Rabbit Holes</a>
    <div class="case-tenets">
      <a href="/clarity/" class="tenet-link">Clarity Tenet</a>
    </div>
    <h1>Signal from Noise</h1>
    <p class="case-tagline">Turning overwhelming sources into accessible, actionable insight</p>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Problem This Solves</h2>
    <div class="case-content">
      <div class="problem-grid">
        <div class="problem-card">
          <span class="problem-quote">"We have too much content and no one reads it"</span>
        </div>
        <div class="problem-card">
          <span class="problem-quote">"The best stuff is buried — users can't find it"</span>
        </div>
        <div class="problem-card">
          <span class="problem-quote">"We're curating manually and it doesn't scale"</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p>
        Whether it's 75,000 books, hours of podcasts, or scattered knowledge bases — 
        the pattern is the same. <strong>Information overload paralyzes decision-making.</strong> 
        People give up instead of finding what they need.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Methodology</h2>
    <div class="case-content">
      <div class="method-steps">
        
        <div class="method-step">
          <div class="step-number">1</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>Systematic Ingestion</h3>
            <p>Build pipelines that pull from sources automatically. No manual upload bottlenecks. The system grows itself.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="method-step">
          <div class="step-number">2</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>AI Enrichment</h3>
            <p>Transform raw content into structured metadata: summaries, difficulty ratings, topic tags, reading time. Make every piece queryable.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="method-step">
          <div class="step-number">3</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>Intelligent Curation</h3>
            <p>Surface <em>what matters</em> based on user context, recency, and quality signals. Not everything — the right things.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="method-step">
          <div class="step-number">4</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>Progressive Disclosure</h3>
            <p>Start simple, go deep when ready. Belt levels for learners. Archive access for explorers. No overwhelm upfront.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">Projects That Prove It</h2>
    <div class="projects-grid">
      
      <div class="project-proof">
        <h3>Freed Reads</h3>
        <p class="project-problem">75,000 free books exist. Nobody reads them.</p>
        <p class="project-solution">Daily curation system surfaces hidden gems with AI-generated context — why read it now, estimated time, difficulty level.</p>
        <div class="project-outcome">
          <span class="outcome-stat">75,000+</span>
          <span class="outcome-label">books indexed</span>
        </div>
        <a href="#freed-reads-deep" class="project-link">See the research →</a>
      </div>
      
      <div class="project-proof">
        <h3>Investing Dojo</h3>
        <p class="project-problem">Financial podcasts are hours long. Who has time?</p>
        <p class="project-solution">Automated transcription → AI summarization → belt-graded curriculum. White Belt to Black Belt progression.</p>
        <div class="project-outcome">
          <span class="outcome-stat">401</span>
          <span class="outcome-label">articles published</span>
        </div>
        <a href="/case-studies/investing-dojo/" class="project-link">View case study →</a>
      </div>
      
      <div class="project-proof">
        <h3>Club Dadvice</h3>
        <p class="project-problem">Parenting content is everywhere — mostly for mums.</p>
        <p class="project-solution">AI-curated wisdom from top parenting podcasts, framed for fathers, organized by challenge.</p>
        <div class="project-outcome">
          <span class="outcome-stat">100+</span>
          <span class="outcome-label">articles searchable by challenge</span>
        </div>
        <a href="/case-studies/club-dadvice/" class="project-link">View case study →</a>
      </div>
      
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section" id="freed-reads-deep">
    <h2 class="section-label">Deep Dive: Freed Reads Evolution</h2>
    <div class="case-content">
      <p class="vision-statement">
        What started as daily book curation is evolving into an 
        <strong>AI-enriched Knowledge Graph</strong> — the most intelligent classic book platform ever built.
      </p>
      
      <h3>The Strategic Vision</h3>
      <div class="vision-grid">
        <div class="vision-card">
          <h4>"Why Read It Now?"</h4>
          <p>AI-generated blurbs connecting classic themes to modern concerns — AI ethics, climate, inequality.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="vision-card">
          <h4>Stylistic Fingerprints</h4>
          <p>Every book gets a vector: sentiment arc, prose complexity, topic distribution. Recommendations based on <em>how</em> books read.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="vision-card">
          <h4>Five Best Quotes</h4>
          <p>Multi-vector extraction: thematic relevance, quotability score, and surprise factor.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="vision-card">
          <h4>Cultural Research Engine</h4>
          <p>Track themes across centuries. When did "duty" decline and "self" rise? Distant reading meets data journalism.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <h3>The Data Insight</h3>
      <div class="insight-box">
        <p class="insight-stat">
          <strong>Frankenstein</strong> is the #1 most-downloaded book — 11,000+ downloads/day.
        </p>
        <p class="insight-why">
          In an age of AI and creation ethics, Mary Shelley's "Modern Prometheus" resonates 
          more than ever. The data reveals the question; the methodology explains the answer.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">When to Use This Methodology</h2>
    <div class="case-content">
      <ul class="use-cases">
        <li><strong>Knowledge bases</strong> that have grown unwieldy</li>
        <li><strong>Content archives</strong> where the best stuff is buried</li>
        <li><strong>Learning platforms</strong> that overwhelm new users</li>
        <li><strong>Research repositories</strong> that need intelligent discovery</li>
        <li><strong>Internal wikis</strong> that nobody uses because they can't find anything</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">Related</h2>
    <div class="related-items">
      <a href="/clarity/" class="related-link">
        <span class="related-icon">💡</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Clarity Tenet</strong>
          <span>The philosophy behind cutting through complexity</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="/ai/" class="related-link">
        <span class="related-icon">🤖</span>
        <div>
          <strong>AI Tenet</strong>
          <span>How I build with AI — the capability behind the pipelines</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section cta-section">
    <h2>Drowning in content?</h2>
    <p>Let's talk about bringing signal from your noise.</p>
    <a href="mailto:dave@wordandmouth.com" class="cta-button">Start a Conversation</a>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero-case {
    padding: 10rem 2rem 4rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  
  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  
  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .case-tenets {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .tenet-link {
    background: rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.15);
    color: var(--accent);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  
  .hero-case h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .case-tagline {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  
  .case-content {
    max-width: 700px;
  }
  
  .case-content p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .case-content strong {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .problem-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  
  .problem-card {
    background: #111;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent);
  }
  
  .problem-quote {
    font-style: italic;
    color: #ccc;
  }
  
  .method-steps {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  
  .method-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  
  .step-number {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    line-height: 1;
    min-width: 2rem;
  }
  
  .step-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .step-content p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1rem !important;
    margin-bottom: 0 !important;
  }
  
  .projects-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  
  .project-proof {
    background: #111;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
  }
  
  .project-proof h3 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .project-problem {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .project-solution {
    color: #ccc;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .project-outcome {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .outcome-stat {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .outcome-label {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  
  .project-link {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  
  .project-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .vision-statement {
    font-size: 1.3rem !important;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem !important;
  }
  
  .case-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
  }
  
  .vision-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  
  .vision-card {
    background: #111;
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }
  
  .vision-card h4 {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .vision-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem !important;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 0 !important;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  
  .insight-box {
    background: #111;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .insight-stat {
    font-size: 1.2rem !important;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem !important;
  }
  
  .insight-why {
    color: var(--muted) !important;
    margin-bottom: 0 !important;
  }
  
  .use-cases {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }
  
  .use-cases li {
    padding: 0.75rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  
  .use-cases li:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  
  .related-items {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  
  .related-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    background: #111;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  
  .related-link:hover {
    border-left-color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .related-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .related-link strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  
  .related-link span {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  
  .cta-section {
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .cta-section h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .cta-section p {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .vision-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    
    .method-step {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }
  }
</style>
